  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧).\n\nASPECT: {保|たも}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing maintenance of a state.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{保|たも}つ (to maintain X)\n- ⟦{健康|けんこう}→健康：02706_kenkou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{保|たも}つ (to maintain health)\n- ⟦{品質|ひんしつ}→品質：09507_hinshitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{保|たも}つ (to maintain quality)\n- ⟦{関係|かんけい}→関係：01298_kankei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{保|たも}つ (to maintain a relationship)\n- ⟦{距離|きょり}→距離：05331_kyori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{保|たも}つ (to keep distance)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{維持|いじ}する→維持する：17311_ijisuru⟧ (to maintain - more formal)\n- ⟦{守|まも}る→守る：01986_mamoru⟧ (to protect/keep)",
